      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE REAL MAN (5) is a progressive type building a good record, in particular this course and distance. This tougher but drops nicely in the weights and drawn well. Can make it a winning hat-trick. HARTMAN (4) is also in top form, most recently recording a win by a long neck over 1650m at this track to make it two on the bounce. Back from a let-up and did win only try course and distance. Sure to be in the finish. CHEROKEE DANCER (2) has a strong record course and distance winning 2/3 runs and drawn to go close. CAPTAIN CAM (3) ran on hard to score on the turf last time at Hobart. This tougher but back in form and drops in the weights. THOROS OF MYR (1) is better than last start in open class and back in grade can improve sharply.",
